ne-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/202606240447337811_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/202606240447337811_720.jpg"> </div><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/202606240712562441_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/202606240712562441_1280.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/202606240712562441_1280.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-24/match1869200date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗双响创纪录！葡萄牙5-0乌兹别克斯坦升榜首 门德斯任意球建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.66" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260624/zhanbao_image_1869200_1782240823_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260624/zhanbao_image_1869200_1782240823_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260624/zhanbao_image_1869200_1782240823_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>C罗梅开二度，努诺·门德斯任意球破门，莱奥替补建功。最终葡萄牙5-0击败乌兹别克斯坦，升至小组榜首。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-24/match1869206date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">爆冷闷平！英格兰0-0加纳 奥赖利中框凯恩错失绝杀英格兰19射4正</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.85" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260624/zhanbao_image_1869206_1782252134_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.85" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.85" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260624/zhanbao_image_1869206_1782252134_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260624/zhanbao_image_1869206_1782252134_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>奥赖利中框，凯恩失绝杀，最终英格兰0-0战平加纳，两队继续位列本组前两位。</p><p><strong>【世界杯数据】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-24/6a3aa5c25ca00native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">历史性时刻！41岁C罗连续6届世界杯破门创纪录，历史仅此一人！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ac95e5c033.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ac95e5c033.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ac95e5c033.jpg"> </div><p>C罗对阵乌兹别克斯坦破门，成为首位连续参加六届世界杯都有进球的球员。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-24/6a3ac570b13d4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">队史第1！41岁C罗超越尤西比奥，10球独享葡萄牙队史世界杯射手王</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ad1c99557e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ad1c99557e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ad1c99557e.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙vs乌兹别克斯坦，C罗梅开二度，以10球超越葡萄牙传奇球星尤西比奥，独享葡萄牙队史世界杯射手王。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-24/6a3ab04ce52canative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">破荒！C罗打入本届世界杯首球，终结世界杯+欧洲杯10场大赛球荒</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.45" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ab3ec98502.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ab3ec98502.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ab3ec98502.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙vs乌兹别克斯坦，C罗破门斩获个人本届赛事首球，也打破了10场大赛（世界杯+欧洲杯）球荒。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-24/6a3ad3158da72native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">41岁双响！官方：C罗当选葡萄牙5-0乌兹别克斯坦全场最佳球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/202606240335041076.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/202606240335041076.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/202606240335041076.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙5-0乌兹别克斯坦，41岁C罗双响，独享葡萄牙世界杯射手王，成功当选本场比赛最佳球员。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-24/6a3ac6e0ce1e0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">纪录追逐我！C罗一战打破多项纪录：唯一6届破门、最年长双响…</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ac9597dfae.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ac9597dfae.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3ac9597dfae.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙5-0大胜乌兹别克斯坦，C罗梅开二度，打破多项纪录，包括连续6届世界杯破门、最年长双响球员等。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-24/6a3ac60577724native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">39岁梅西、27岁姆巴佩、25岁哈兰德昨天双响 今天41岁C罗同样双响</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/202606240337592374.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/202606240337592374.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/202606240337592374.jpg"> </div><p>本届世界杯第二轮比赛，梅西、姆巴佩、哈兰德梅开二度，今天C罗也完成双响！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-24/6a3ac0dfb8b1enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">41岁138天！C罗成世界杯第二年长进球球员，仅次于42岁的米拉</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-24/6a3ac42f688d0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">传奇继续！C罗生涯打入975球 俱乐部1097场830球国家队230场145球</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zu